  "question": {
    "text": "$\\int \\frac{\\log \\sqrt{x}}{3 x} d x$ is equal to"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "$\\frac{1}{3}(\\log \\sqrt{x})^{2}+C$",
      "is_correct": true
    },
    {
      "text": "$\\frac{2}{3}(\\log \\sqrt{x})^{2}+C$",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "$\\frac{2}{3}(\\log x)^{2}+C$",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "$\\frac{1}{3}(\\log x)^{2}+C$",
      "is_correct": false
    }
  ],
  "correct_answer": [
    "A"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "Let $I=\\int \\frac{\\log \\sqrt{x}}{3 x} d x$\r\nAqain, let $\\log \\sqrt{x}=z \\Rightarrow \\frac{1}{2 x} d x=d z$\r\n$I=\\int \\frac{2 z}{3} d z=\\frac{2}{3} \\int z d z$\r\n$=\\frac{2}{3} \\cdot \\frac{z^{2}}{2}+C=\\frac{1}{3} \\left(\\log \\sqrt{x}\\right)^{2}+C$"
  }
}